WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Watch Faisal.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.200
Narrator: STOP at the entrance, with the words.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.700
Faisal: Stop here please.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.300
Narrator: GO-MOVE into lane two - a big sweep, repeated.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.800
Faisal: This way please.

6
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:35.000
Narrator: Then his supervisor radios a hold, and Faisal gives HOLD - steady, calm, and he tells the fans why they're waiting.

7
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.500
Faisal: Please wait here.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.500
Narrator: STOP.

9
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Narrator: GO-MOVE.

10
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.500
Narrator: HOLD.

